+   "title": "Check for open recalls",
+   "instructions": "Run your VIN at nhtsa.gov/recalls. Certain 2007 and 2009-2012 CBR600RRs are in recall 24V864 for a fuel pump impeller that can deform. Book any open recall with a Honda dealer.",
+   "reason": "A failing fuel pump can stall the bike. The repair is free."
+  },
+  "F-002": {
+   "title": "Test the charging system",
+   "instructions": "With a charged battery, measure voltage at the battery at idle and at higher rpm. If it's low or high, test the regulator/rectifier and the stator.",
+   "reason": "The regulator/rectifier on these bikes can overheat and fail, leaving a dead battery."
+  }
+ },
